    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81511" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικεφάλ-αιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ],
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>round
				the head</i> : hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περικεφαλαία, ἡ</span>, <i>covering for the head, helmet, cap</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Call.Com.
				1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				24.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.328
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σιδηρᾶ περιηργυρωμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					11(2).161
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				77
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				22.1478.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12(5).647.30
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Ceos</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.71.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				6.9.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.36.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>wig</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>disorder of the oak</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.8.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> in a ship, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ στόλος ὑπὲρ τὴν
				στεῖραν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.86
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				3.13.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> name of a
				<i>bandage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fasc.</u>
				24
			</span></i>.</div>
